  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decarbonizing Artisanal Fisheries in Tunisia: Promoting Clean Energy for Sustainable Coastal Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to test a self-financing model that can deliver solar electric motor retrofits to small-scale fishers in the Gulf of Gab&#xe8;s at scale. This could lead to material reductions in fuel and noise pollution, carbon emissions and operating costs for fishers, as well as enabling the incorporation of a no-take zone protecting blue carbon ecosystems and improving the livelihoods of the fishers and their families.</narrative>
  </description>
